.TH DANBY-BADMINTON 1
.SH NAME
danby-badminton \- high-drag shuttlecock trajectories
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/badminton
.SH MODEL
The shuttlecock follows gravity plus velocity-squared drag.  Its unusually
large area-to-mass ratio makes rapid deceleration the dominant feature, visibly
separating the path from a vacuum parabola.
.SH DISPLAY
The plots show height versus distance and speed versus time.  Tracks alter
speed, angle, drag, lift, spin, and gravity.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/badminton.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR trajectory (2)
